          <div><span>Local source gate</span><strong>290 passed · 3 skipped</strong><small>Ruff, packaged resources, MCP reproduction, TypeScript, UI build, and generated comparison passed.</small></div>
          <div><span>Clean install</span><strong>Verified offline</strong><small>Fresh Python 3.12.13 environment, portable verification, provider calls 0; native qualification stayed separate.</small></div>
          <div><span>Hosted CI</span><strong>Did not start</strong><small>GitHub billing/spending annotation; this is an external hold, not a passing CI result.</small></div>
          <div><span>Excluded work</span><strong>None dispatched</strong><small>No provider, native installation, GPU, Docker, fx, Edge, benchmark, or customer execution.</small></div>
