      <section class="ew-section" id="future">
        <div class="section-intro">
          <div><p class="section-code">09 / Long-term operating model</p><h2>Private methods.<br />Customer-owned truth.</h2></div>
          <p>The durable advantage is not a secret score. It is a disciplined exchange: customer evidence stays governed; private methods generate inspectable proposals; accepted evaluation assets remain portable.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="feature-figure feature-figure--future">
          <img src="/img/explainers/eval-workbench/customer-edge-boundary.webp" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A customer-owned workshop keeps keys, evidence, tests, and archives locally while exchanging one reviewed proposal card with a separate methods studio across a narrow bridge." loading="lazy" />
